OL,3,ALib Dems would cut income tax, says Ed
OL,4,ADavey in conference speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe speech started with him warning
OL,7,Fsome want to "tear our country apart"
OL,8,Fas he refers to anti-migrant protests
OL,9,Fin Dover and Portsmouth
OL,11,FDavey also warned of the "existential
OL,12,Fthreat" of AI and says a treaty is
OL,13,Fneeded to press pause "before it's too
OL,14,Flate"
OL,16,FTurning to maternity care, the Lib Dem
OL,17,Fleader says his party would give
OL,18,Fmothers-to-be one-to-one care
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
